 romance robot named Nadeshiko. The very source of her worries, Nadeshiko, appears to be sleeping soundly beside her. Huh? ...Come to think of it, robots don't sleep, do they? Is she powered down? Akane manages to charge Nadeshiko safely, but then realizes she doesn't know how to restart her...?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3dKnbxOG6gsiUeRWDF7EoGJ7Ppr.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Akane jolts awake from a nightmare in which her workplace discovers she bought an illegal romance robot named Nadeshiko. The very source of her worries, Nadeshiko, appears to be sleeping soundly beside her. Huh? ...Come to think of it, robots don't sleep, do they? Is she powered down? Akane manages to charge Nadeshiko safely, but then realizes she doesn't know how to restart her...?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3dKnbxOG6gsiUeRWDF7EoGJ7Ppr.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"19330","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"192867","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"61694","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"291414","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"463638","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"104021","synopsis":"Seeing Akane exhausted from her grueling work, Nadeshiko offers her a regular massage. Following that, Nadeshiko asks Akane to perform a “Master Authentication,” but Akane refuses the request. Master Authentication would mean becoming Nadeshiko's owner, but Akane explains she can't treat Nadeshiko like an object because she feels too human for that. Akane says she'd rather start as friends first, to which Nadeshiko responds...?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8fjCbH4jdYlJGccNTcols3AyNTa.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4